1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,935
 Today we went to Cat Island, where more cats live than people!

2
00:00:07,936 --> 00:00:16,603
We take a closer look at the reality of an island called a cat paradise!

3
00:00:25,869 --> 00:00:36,534
First we take the train to get to Cat Island.

4
00:00:36,535 --> 00:00:47,701
It takes about an hour to get to the destination station

5
00:01:00,834 --> 00:01:06,534
We have arrived at our destination, Iyo Nagahama station

6
00:01:06,535 --> 00:01:15,950
More ferry rides to get to the island

7
00:01:15,950 --> 00:01:21,267
The boat makes two round trips per day. One way ¥700 ($5.27)

8
00:01:21,268 --> 00:01:27,868
Small boats, so it seems to happen quite a bit in the winter when the waves are high.

9
00:01:27,869 --> 00:01:35,406
Tickets can be purchased inside the boat

10
00:01:35,407 --> 00:01:40,868
Tickets purchased for round trip

11
00:01:40,869 --> 00:01:50,000
It takes about 30 minutes to get to Aoshima by ferry

12
00:01:50,001 --> 00:02:00,247
There are no accommodations, stores, or vending machines at all on Aoshima, where we are going

13
00:02:00,247 --> 00:02:08,334
So you will need to prepare food for your cat in advance

14
00:02:08,335 --> 00:02:16,534
Cat Island in sight!

15
00:02:16,535 --> 00:02:24,373
Where are the cats?

16
00:02:34,314 --> 00:02:42,416
Ah! I found the cat!

17
00:02:42,417 --> 00:03:04,534
Were they waiting for the boat to arrive? Two cats greeted me!

18
00:03:04,535 --> 00:03:11,733
The skinship is very skinny!

19
00:03:11,733 --> 00:03:19,534
I don't think he can see me.

20
00:03:19,535 --> 00:03:27,534
It is said that there are now over 100 cats living on Aoshima

21
00:03:27,535 --> 00:03:38,801
Famous cat island in Japan, many tourists visit the island every year

22
00:03:38,802 --> 00:03:46,734
There are only a few places where you can feed the cats.

23
00:03:46,735 --> 00:03:57,927
When we came to the feeding area, there were already many tourists and cats

24
00:03:57,927 --> 00:04:09,569
Besides tourists, support groups are feeding cat food

25
00:04:09,570 --> 00:04:20,000
Everyone is so enthusiastic about eating the food.

26
00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:32,668
Their winter fur is so fluffy and cute!

27
00:04:32,669 --> 00:04:44,401
Volunteers are giving water and food to the cats

28
00:04:44,402 --> 00:04:53,834
The rule is to take all trash home and not overfeed them!

29
00:04:53,835 --> 00:05:01,201
I'll follow the rules and feed mine.

30
00:05:01,202 --> 00:05:07,534
Now for the memorial feeding!

31
00:05:07,535 --> 00:05:11,494
Ouch！！！！

32
00:05:11,495 --> 00:05:16,772
I got catpunched...

33
00:05:16,773 --> 00:05:21,899
Ohhhh... my food...

34
00:05:21,900 --> 00:05:30,468
I'm the one who wants to squeal...

35
00:05:30,469 --> 00:05:37,234
And there was a fight going on nearby...

36
00:05:37,235 --> 00:05:45,935
The cats are gathering in some parts of the area for food, which makes it easier for fights to break out

37
00:05:45,936 --> 00:05:54,377
I'm going to break up the fight.

38
00:05:54,378 --> 00:06:03,901
Looks like the white cat had the upper hand.

39
00:06:03,902 --> 00:06:12,720
Let's feed the losing cat.

40
00:06:12,721 --> 00:06:22,518
They're getting closer.

41
00:06:22,519 --> 00:06:32,278
He's very wary, he won't come closer.

42
00:06:32,279 --> 00:06:39,138
I'm going to move away a little bit.

43
00:06:39,139 --> 00:06:45,320
I came to eat right away. Good, good, good.

44
00:06:45,321 --> 00:06:53,498
Looks like you were quite hungry.

45
00:06:53,499 --> 00:07:03,234
The other cats were approaching, probably sensing the food

46
00:07:03,235 --> 00:07:11,864
He seems to have forgotten that he catpunched me earlier

47
00:07:15,119 --> 00:07:21,752
Oh!!! Please be friendly with me!

48
00:07:21,753 --> 00:07:28,876
Now I've been catpunched!

49
00:07:28,876 --> 00:07:35,701
It's only been a few minutes since we landed, but a lot is happening!

50
00:07:35,701 --> 00:07:52,734
Seems like we should feed them in several places.

51
00:07:52,735 --> 00:08:01,734
They are all feeding well together, aren't they? Good.

52
00:08:01,735 --> 00:08:09,159
There is a shrine on the island

53
00:08:16,903 --> 00:08:25,534
The elevated location provides a panoramic view of Aoshima

54
00:08:25,535 --> 00:08:31,951
Prayer.

55
00:08:31,952 --> 00:08:39,564
May you get along well with the cats living on Aoshima...

56
00:08:39,565 --> 00:08:45,784
One cat approaching!

57
00:08:45,784 --> 00:08:53,209
Looks like my wish came true early!

58
00:09:00,335 --> 00:09:06,365
They are very interested in the food I have!

59
00:09:06,366 --> 00:09:16,238
Maybe it's not for me, but for the food?

60
00:09:16,239 --> 00:09:23,701
I feel like they're asking me to feed them.

61
00:09:23,702 --> 00:09:32,501
Unfortunately you can't feed them at the shrine

62
00:09:32,502 --> 00:09:40,340
When I try to go down the stairs, he comes down with me

63
00:09:40,340 --> 00:09:49,158
Very friendly natured cat. Cute.

64
00:09:49,159 --> 00:09:57,675
I am very happy and will feed him again!

65
00:09:57,676 --> 00:10:09,334
Brown, black, white cats, and other patterns are totally different!

66
00:10:09,335 --> 00:10:18,341
I'm going to feed the cat that's quiet on the bench.

67
00:10:18,342 --> 00:10:28,634
Another cat has come to eat

68
00:10:28,635 --> 00:10:36,398
He's very concerned about it

69
00:10:36,398 --> 00:10:43,597
But he doesn't sidestep. He's a patient boy.

70
00:10:43,598 --> 00:10:53,056
I'll give it to him after he's finished eating now.

71
00:10:53,057 --> 00:10:58,070
Ah!

72
00:10:59,818 --> 00:11:09,690
 I'm sorry. My bad.

73
00:11:09,691 --> 00:11:18,490
It was my mistake to bring the cup.

74
00:11:18,490 --> 00:11:26,704
Come on, eat a lot.

75
00:11:26,705 --> 00:11:37,180
I want to feed the quiet cat, but the other cats are very strong

76
00:11:43,335 --> 00:11:58,868
Cats seem to have different personalities

77
00:11:58,869 --> 00:12:04,598
When you're done feeding them...

78
00:12:04,599 --> 00:12:13,935
The cats started grooming

79
00:12:13,936 --> 00:12:26,734
They are in relax mode

80
00:12:26,735 --> 00:12:33,106
The last flight has arrived

81
00:12:33,106 --> 00:12:41,019
If we miss this boat, we'll be in the field, so we'll come back tomorrow

82
00:12:41,020 --> 00:12:50,801
We were only ashore for an hour, but we thoroughly enjoyed it!

83
00:12:50,802 --> 00:13:07,014
If you want to fully enjoy the cats, I recommend coming on a morning flight!

84
00:13:18,202 --> 00:13:26,734
If you live in Aoshima, you have to go shopping by boat, which is very difficult!

85
00:13:41,302 --> 00:13:51,534
I'm staying at a guest house this time

86
00:13:51,534 --> 00:13:59,561
Reservations are only made by phone in advance

87
00:13:59,562 --> 00:14:11,657
Rooms are Japanese style and include breakfast and dinner for ¥7000 ($52)

88
00:14:11,658 --> 00:14:23,301
The corridor is very cold, but the room is very warm and well heated!

89
00:14:37,602 --> 00:14:51,234
The bath is also very safe, as if you were back in your parents' house

90
00:14:51,235 --> 00:15:04,101
Dinner is moved to a ryotei restaurant a short distance from the inn

91
00:15:04,102 --> 00:15:13,501
A private room with a TV for a very relaxing meal

92
00:15:13,502 --> 00:15:20,000
And this is dinner! Gorgeous!!!!

93
00:15:20,001 --> 00:15:30,890
Aji sashimi, fried aji, deep-fried aji, and side dishes... it's more gorgeous than you can imagine!

94
00:15:30,890 --> 00:15:39,134
This is a great deal for ¥7,000 including lodging!

95
00:15:39,135 --> 00:15:50,701
The sashimi is very fresh and very elegant!

96
00:15:50,702 --> 00:15:59,834
Every dish is delicious!

97
00:15:59,835 --> 00:16:14,334
If you come to Aoshima, this is definitely the place to come to eat!

98
00:16:14,335 --> 00:16:25,752
After dinner, we buy cat food at a nearby supermarket

99
00:16:25,753 --> 00:16:36,416
All this is cat food. A huge amount!

100
00:16:36,417 --> 00:16:49,114
Tomorrow we will be on Cat Island all day, so we will buy more food!

101
00:16:59,735 --> 00:17:07,935
I will also buy my own food for lunch tomorrow

102
00:17:07,936 --> 00:17:14,381
Then I'm going to bed to prepare for tomorrow.

103
00:17:14,382 --> 00:17:19,101
Good night...

104
00:17:24,102 --> 00:17:29,134
Good morning...

105
00:17:29,135 --> 00:17:38,744
Breakfast is very fresh and delicious rice!

106
00:17:38,745 --> 00:17:45,301
When you come to Aoshima, you must stay here, breakfast and dinner included!

107
00:17:45,302 --> 00:17:53,634
After checking out, we will head to the boat pier as soon as possible!

108
00:17:53,635 --> 00:18:00,193
There seem to be fewer tourists on the morning flight

109
00:18:17,335 --> 00:18:26,000
We were able to see the sunrise while on the boat

110
00:18:33,101 --> 00:18:40,450
Good morning

111
00:18:40,450 --> 00:18:47,534
Very early riser cat.

112
00:18:47,535 --> 00:18:54,357
Good morning

113
00:18:54,357 --> 00:19:00,651
The fur is nice and fluffy

114
00:19:01,142 --> 00:19:05,779
Oh!

115
00:19:05,780 --> 00:19:13,317
The skinship is intense today too!

116
00:19:16,124 --> 00:19:24,935
I was left behind again

117
00:19:24,936 --> 00:19:35,449
How close are you guys?

118
00:19:35,450 --> 00:19:46,534
A very soothing sight.

119
00:19:46,535 --> 00:19:55,701
Still working on it...

120
00:19:55,702 --> 00:20:01,996
Say hello to another cat

121
00:20:01,997 --> 00:20:11,530
So cute!!! He came close to me!

122
00:20:18,000 --> 00:20:27,766
Cats are nocturnal, but they are all already awake!

123
00:20:27,766 --> 00:20:35,053
I wonder if they recognize me as someone who feeds them

124
00:20:35,054 --> 00:20:39,234
They follow behind me.

125
00:20:39,235 --> 00:20:47,715
It's breakfast time for the cats

126
00:20:47,715 --> 00:20:57,512
More cats have gathered than yesterday

127
00:20:57,513 --> 00:21:06,933
I feed them with both hands to prevent a fight from breaking out

128
00:21:10,207 --> 00:21:13,262
That's it!

129
00:21:13,263 --> 00:21:19,745
The chirping has stopped, and at once the battle for food has begun!

130
00:21:19,746 --> 00:21:30,999
The volunteers are supposed to be feeding them, but they eat a lot of my food too!

131
00:21:30,999 --> 00:21:42,101
My feeding has improved since yesterday.

132
00:21:52,534 --> 00:22:04,216
I must have bought quite a lot of food, but I am going to run out in the morning!

133
00:22:22,635 --> 00:22:30,549
No fights have occurred so far, so it's a relatively peaceful meal!

134
00:22:30,550 --> 00:22:38,426
We feed the cats that can't get into the ring.

135
00:22:38,426 --> 00:22:44,734
But other cats soon come and take the food

136
00:22:44,735 --> 00:22:50,389
Let's give him some special high-grade food.

137
00:22:50,390 --> 00:22:55,301
They look like they're eating well.

138
00:22:55,302 --> 00:22:59,524
Ouch！！！！

139
00:22:59,525 --> 00:23:06,701
It's not easy to feed them

140
00:23:06,702 --> 00:23:11,868
Aoshima now has 100 cats and 3 residents

141
00:23:11,869 --> 00:23:19,468
Residents are congregated near the boat dock, which is off limits to tourists for privacy reasons

142
00:23:19,469 --> 00:23:30,773
We were not able to visit "Bentenzaki" at the tip of the island this time!

143
00:23:30,774 --> 00:23:39,601
Tourists are prevented from entering.

144
00:23:39,602 --> 00:23:58,801
The area near the feeding station is uninhabited, but access is limited due to the age of the building

145
00:23:58,802 --> 00:24:11,734
Aoshima, which developed around fishing, had 889 inhabitants in 1942, but the population has been gradually declining and now stands at 3

146
00:24:11,735 --> 00:24:26,534
There was a school in the past, but it is now closed and off limits

147
00:24:26,535 --> 00:24:36,595
Looks like the cat has found something.

148
00:24:36,596 --> 00:24:46,883
I'm going to try to follow it

149
00:24:52,189 --> 00:25:00,743
What did you find?

150
00:25:00,744 --> 00:25:08,734
I looked down there and didn't see anything

151
00:25:16,848 --> 00:25:23,330
Oh my God. A fight has started

152
00:25:23,331 --> 00:25:29,776
Looks like there is a cat in the clay pipe

153
00:25:29,777 --> 00:25:45,834
I don't want to see as much fighting as possible, so I'll stop

154
00:25:45,835 --> 00:25:53,134
Surely one cat is hiding in the back

155
00:25:53,135 --> 00:26:06,267
It calms the other one down

156
00:26:27,535 --> 00:26:35,637
When you are on an island, you often encounter cat fights

157
00:26:35,638 --> 00:26:44,531
Even from a distance you can hear the cats fighting with each other

158
00:26:44,532 --> 00:26:56,740
They fight throughout the night, so it makes a lot of noise for the people who live there

159
00:27:02,402 --> 00:27:10,994
I thought cat island was supposed to be calm and relaxing, but the reality is different

160
00:27:10,995 --> 00:27:20,000
The number of cats on Aoshima increased around 2013 when the number of tourists increased

161
00:27:20,001 --> 00:27:33,226
The number of cats increased to more than 200 because tourists fed them a lot and they were unneutered and unspayed at that time

162
00:27:41,041 --> 00:27:54,534
Interceding to prevent cats from fighting and falling into the sea

163
00:28:05,202 --> 00:28:16,506
They gave up the fight and went away

164
00:28:16,507 --> 00:28:23,134
They're gone. Good for you.

165
00:28:23,135 --> 00:28:32,405
It's lunchtime, so we're going to have lunch

166
00:28:32,406 --> 00:28:43,032
I decide to eat in the waiting room because the cats are likely to come if I eat outside

167
00:28:43,033 --> 00:28:54,676
The waiting room is cleaned and very clean

168
00:28:54,677 --> 00:29:04,502
Cats are not allowed in the building

169
00:29:04,502 --> 00:29:12,303
I gently opened the door and found many cats waiting for me

170
00:29:12,304 --> 00:29:19,464
Cute...

171
00:29:19,465 --> 00:29:29,067
Wait a little while until you finish eating

172
00:29:29,068 --> 00:29:39,434
Lunch is a half-price bento I bought at the supermarket last night

173
00:29:39,435 --> 00:29:45,434
It is full of volume. Tempura of burdock

174
00:29:45,435 --> 00:29:51,668
Is it a handmade bento? Very tasty.

175
00:29:51,669 --> 00:29:58,601
It is fried horse mackerel. Aji is fresh and very tasty in Ehime.

176
00:29:58,602 --> 00:30:07,194
The waiting room is decorated with many pictures of the former Aoshima

177
00:30:07,195 --> 00:30:14,694
There are also remnants of a store that used to be there in the past

178
00:30:14,695 --> 00:30:23,136
What are these drawers?

179
00:30:23,137 --> 00:30:34,134
Oh! Lots of catnip in there!

180
00:30:34,135 --> 00:30:41,484
I'm going to borrow one and play with my cat

181
00:30:41,485 --> 00:30:51,395
Many cats were still waiting for me at the door!

182
00:30:51,396 --> 00:30:58,746
Will they play with us?

183
00:30:58,746 --> 00:31:07,301
Oh, wow!!! One of them responded!

184
00:31:07,301 --> 00:31:15,201
Looks like he's having so much fun!

185
00:31:15,202 --> 00:31:24,999
I couldn't find cat toys in the supermarket, so having them on the island would be very helpful!

186
00:31:33,635 --> 00:31:41,549
I'll play with the other cats.

187
00:31:41,550 --> 00:31:48,070
Huh? Is he responding?

188
00:31:48,071 --> 00:31:52,003
Hmm?

189
00:31:52,003 --> 00:31:58,410
There was a cat that was fighting frequently just now

190
00:31:58,411 --> 00:32:07,116
It's all very tense at once

191
00:32:17,344 --> 00:32:23,224
and here comes the arbitration

192
00:32:23,225 --> 00:32:32,571
Here comes the cat with a lot of skinship

193
00:32:32,571 --> 00:32:39,868
The air that was tense for a moment is now calm again

194
00:32:39,869 --> 00:32:47,632
No reaction at all to the toys

195
00:33:02,280 --> 00:33:11,098
We are back on peaceful Cat Island again.

196
00:33:11,098 --> 00:33:19,352
Even the cat that fights so easily got on my lap! Cute.

197
00:33:24,735 --> 00:33:31,067
I wanna play with those cats at the feeders too!

198
00:33:31,068 --> 00:33:38,455
Oh!!! They're all sleeping.

199
00:33:38,455 --> 00:33:45,013
Maybe we shouldn't force them to wake up

200
00:33:45,013 --> 00:33:54,534
Currently all cats on Aoshima are neutered and no kittens are born

201
00:33:54,535 --> 00:34:04,219
So most of the cats on Aoshima are older cats and eventually the cats will disappear from the island

202
00:34:04,220 --> 00:34:13,267
Three of the residents are also elderly and have made the decision that there will be no one left to take care of the cats

203
00:34:13,268 --> 00:34:20,868
Speaking of which, it seems that there is a famous cat on Aoshima that looks exactly like an anime character

204
00:34:20,869 --> 00:34:30,554
They don't seem to be at the feeding station ...

205
00:34:30,554 --> 00:34:41,734
He is an older cat and seems to rarely go outside

206
00:34:41,735 --> 00:34:52,935
All the cats on the island are strays, so the residents don't know where they usually are

207
00:35:05,402 --> 00:35:14,333
I met a resident and we had a little chat

208
00:35:14,334 --> 00:35:24,206
The cat that looks just like the cartoon character is called "Dokin-chan" and does not show up at the feeding area!

209
00:35:24,207 --> 00:35:37,401
And cats wearing collars are cats that are friendly to people and are all stray cats.

210
00:35:37,402 --> 00:35:45,918
A resident helped us find "Dokin-chan" and brought her to us!

211
00:35:45,919 --> 00:35:55,101
Finally, we meet Dokin-chan!

212
00:35:55,101 --> 00:36:04,134
This cat is famous for its resemblance to the cartoon character "Dokin-chan"!

213
00:36:04,135 --> 00:36:13,668
Elderly female cat that rarely goes outside.

214
00:36:13,669 --> 00:36:24,901
She is a very beautiful cat!

215
00:36:24,902 --> 00:36:35,980
She looks very comfortable after being out for so long!

216
00:36:48,435 --> 00:37:11,734
I'm glad I came to Aoshima early in the morning...we met at the last minute!

217
00:37:11,735 --> 00:37:21,268
It's a strange pattern, different from other cats

218
00:37:30,497 --> 00:37:41,235
There was a cat flu epidemic in Aoshima and he was even hospitalized at one point!

219
00:37:41,235 --> 00:37:50,000
He is now discharged from the hospital and is doing well in Aoshima, although his diet has become thin!

220
00:37:50,000 --> 00:37:59,267
Residents, thank you for letting me meet you!

221
00:37:59,268 --> 00:38:08,462
After a while, "Dokin-chan" left

222
00:38:08,463 --> 00:38:17,130
The way she walks is graceful and dignified

223
00:38:17,131 --> 00:38:25,346
I hope you will always be in good health.

224
00:38:31,735 --> 00:38:36,861
We are also raising funds to protect cats in Aoshima!

225
00:38:36,862 --> 00:38:43,701
Please help us!

226
00:38:43,702 --> 00:38:49,334
Afternoon boats have arrived at Aoshima

227
00:38:49,335 --> 00:38:57,362
The island is once again bustling with activity as many tourists arrive

228
00:38:57,363 --> 00:39:02,901
Everyone is getting lots of food.

229
00:39:02,902 --> 00:39:13,734
I'll give you all the rest of my food too.

230
00:39:13,735 --> 00:39:21,611
Come on, come on! Come here! I've got food!

231
00:39:25,205 --> 00:39:29,334
Oh the same cat ate me!

232
00:39:29,335 --> 00:39:39,034
My first cat island was a calm and harsh reality similar to human society

233
00:39:39,034 --> 00:39:49,683
Maybe people and cats are the same

234
00:39:49,684 --> 00:40:00,912
Please come and visit Cat Island, everyone!

235
00:40:03,701 --> 00:40:14,477
It was a very productive 2 days!

236
00:40:14,478 --> 00:40:25,201
Thank you to the residents of Aoshima and their cats!

237
00:40:25,202 --> 00:40:35,866
And thank you for watching this video to the end!

238
00:40:35,866 --> 00:40:47,545
Where should we go next?

